A container a lazy line folded into is still open

```
- x
  :::
  a
d
  b
  :::
.
<ul>
  <li>x
:::
a
d
b
:::</li>
</ul>
```

```
- x
  :::
  a
d
  b
.
<ul>
  <li>x
:::
a
d
b</li>
</ul>
```

```
- x
  > a
d
  > b
.
<ul>
  <li>x
&gt; a
d
&gt; b</li>
</ul>
```

```
- > a
d
  > b
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <blockquote><p>a
d
b</p></blockquote>
  </li>
</ul>
```

```
- x
  ::: note
d
  b
.
<ul>
  <li>x
::: note
d
b</li>
</ul>
```
